stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PLACED : Checkout Completed & Inventory Reserved
    
    PLACED --> CONFIRMED : Payment Captured / Manager Approved
    CONFIRMED --> SHIPPED : Dispatched from Warehouse (Tracking Attached)
    SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : Confirmed Delivery by Carrier
    DELIVERED --> [*]

    PLACED --> CANCELLED : Customer Cancellation
    CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : Admin Cancellation Before Dispatch
    CANCELLED --> [*] : Compensating Inventory Restock
